   "date": "2012-09-06T19:30:17Z",
   "subject": "Re: [stan-users] Error when fitting multivariate probit",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n                <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:13px\">Thanks Matt and Bob for the helpful suggestions. Will give them a go. <br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:13px\">Matt, yeah we have been working with this form of multivariate probit in BUGS/JAGS for a while but it has been really difficult to get it to converge without a relatively informative inverse-wishart prior. My hope was that stan might do a better job. Lets hope so.</div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:13px\">Cheers,</div>\r\n                <div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><div>Will Morris M.Phil.</div><div>--- <a href=\"http://wkmor1.wordpress.com\" style=\"color:rgb(0,106,227)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://wkmor1.wordpress.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469031355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3iQlocpx39XKpZzx9zGzxc\">http://wkmor1.wordpress.com</a></div><div>Publications: <a href=\"http://scholar.google.com.au/citations?user=kgytuo0AAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" style=\"font-size:10pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://scholar.google.com.au/citations?user%3Dkgytuo0AAAAJ%26hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469031355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0W-BZn0TB0uuSsxAONDOky\">Google Scholar</a></div><div>Twitter: @wkmor1</div><div>Skype: wkmor1</div><div>Phone: <a href=\"tel:+61%203%208344%208086\" value=\"+61383448086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+61 3 8344 8086</a></div><div>----------------------------------------------------------------------</div><div>Quantitative and Applied Ecology Group</div><div>--- <a href=\"http://qaeco.com\" style=\"color:rgb(0,106,227)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://qaeco.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469031355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3exwne7Z4w77OljzPtFE08\">http://qaeco.com</a></div><div>The School of Botany</div><div>The University of Melbourne</div><div>----------------------------------------------------------------------</div><div>Environmental Decisions Group</div><div>--- <a href=\"http://www.edg.org.au/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,106,227)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.edg.org.au/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=